---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="home" description="Isa is a Product Manager and writer on sabbatical." url="https://isabbatical.net">

  <!-- ILLUSTRATED ACCENT — replace comment with <img> when ready -->

  <div class="intro">
    <p>
      Hi! I'm Isa. I'm a Product Manager and speculative fiction author
      currently on sabbatical. I'm documenting my sabbatical projects in this portfolio
      to teach myself how to use new tools (and get better at building in public).
    </p>
    <p class="cue">Learn more below ↓</p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>About me</h2>
    <p>
      I'm a <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/victoriaisabelyap/">Lead PM</a> with a background working on fullstack teams across web and mobile.
      Most recently I was at Klaviyo for 4.5 years, working primarily on our data platform/infrastructure.
      I'm using this sabbatical to better understand the current tech landscape, and figure out where and what I want to build next.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm also a <a href="https://isabelyap.com" target="_blank">published author</a> of sci-fi, fantasy, and horror.
      You can buy my (award-winning :D) story collection <a href="https://isabelyap.com/never-have-i-ever" target="_blank">here</a>,
      or at the retailer of your choice.
    </p>
    <p>I am currently based in New York City.</p>
    <p>Want the longer version? <a href="/about">It's here</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Writing: essays &amp; notes</h2>
    <p>
      Occasional thoughts on what I'm learning, where I'm walking,
      and what the inside of my brain is like. <a href="/essays">Read them here</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Writing: fiction</h2>
    <p>
      I write fiction, mostly about girls and monsters. I also sometimes write poetry.
      My published work and forthcoming stories live at <a href="https://isabelyap.com" target="_blank">isabelyap.com</a>.
      My author newsletter, where I share writing advice, is at <a href="https://visyap.mymagic.page/" target="_blank">hot yuzu tea</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Sabbatical Sidequests</h2>
    <p>Things I'm working on/learning/exploring this year:</p>
    <ul class="sidequests">
      <li>Shikoku Henro</li>
      <li><a href="/sidequests/new-york">New York</a></li>
      <li>Protein</li>
      <li>Head vs chest voice</li>
      <li><a href="/sidequests/ddia">DDIA (the jumping boar data platform book)</a></li>
      <li>Learning more effectively</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Stay in touch</h2>
    <p>
      I'm thinking of sending an infrequent newsletter of sabbatical
      updates (like, every 2-3 weeks). If that sounds appealing, sign up here:
    </p>
    <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="2af6c0e7-e9b7-43c0-9610-50f3ec089034" />
      <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="isabbatical newsletter signup" />
      <div class="form-row">
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required />
        <button type="submit">Sign up</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Say hello</h2>
    <p>Want to chat about any of the above?</p>
    <p>Send me a note at hello [at] isabbatical [dot] net.</p>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .intro {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .intro p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  section {
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
  padding-top: 2.5rem;
	}

	section p {
	font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

  .cue {
    font-family: var(--font-sans) !important;
    font-size: 0.85rem !important; /*force override*/
    color: var(--ink-light) !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .sidequests {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.4rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .sidequests li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 0.2rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sidequests li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--ink-light);
  }

  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  input[type="email"],
  input[type="text"],
  textarea {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 180px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  input:focus, textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  button[type="submit"] {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bg);
    border: none;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.4rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  button[type="submit"]:hover { background: var(--accent); }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .sidequests { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .form-row { flex-direction: column; }
    input[type="email"] { min-width: 0; }
  }
</style>